docs {
  ## Method, Endpoint, and Auth

  `POST /api/v1/groups` — Bearer access token required.

  ## Description

  Creates a group and adds the requester as its owner and first member.

  ## Request

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | `Bearer <access-token>` |
  | `Content-Type` | `string` | Yes | `application/json` |

  ### Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `title` | `string` | Yes | Group title, 1–150 characters. |
  | `description` | `string` | No | Group description, up to 5000 characters. |

  ## Response

  **`201 Created`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 42,
      "title": "Weekend trip",
      "description": "just test",
      "created_by_user_id": 7,
      "status": "ACTIVE",
      "is_premium": false,
      "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-04T10:00:00Z",
      "member_count": 1
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  - `400 GROUP_INVALID_PAYLOAD` — Missing or invalid title/description.
  - `401 MISSING_TOKEN` — Access token is missing or invalid.
  - `500 INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR` — Group could not be created.
}
